# Text files are committed and checked out with LF on every platform,
# whatever core.autocrlf says. uspace-core vendors knowledge/vectors/ by
# copying a checkout and pins each file's SHA-256: a CRLF working copy
# breaks the pin. Every file in the index is already LF. Same rules as
# uspace-core's .gitattributes.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
